n't like is his government's  announcements on the economy and how  they intend and to manage the economy  they change every day the government's  policies on the oil sector on new  contracts on exploration have caused the  markets to Whirlwind but despite these  missteps Petra's approval ratings remain  strong with half the country supporting  its Administration and polls that's 20  points higher than its predecessor at  this point which means Petro still has a  large political Capital to spend as it  tries to advance in transforming one of  the most unequal countries on Earth
 

